  "description": "This protocol automates the distribution of patient samples to the wells of up to three 384-well plates in a specific arrangement shown in the attached plate map. The number of columns filled with patient sample for each plate can be specified (as a single comma-separated string of values between 1 and 12 like \"8,8,12\") in the parameters below.\nLinks:\n* PCR/qPCR prep: distribution of primers to 384-well plates\n\nplate map\n\n\n\n\nOpentrons P20-multi channel electronic pipettes (GEN2)\n\n\nOpentrons 20ul Filter Tips",
